SUMMARY:Feed Dating: Around the World in 8 Dates
LOCATION:VFW Post 4651\, 7 Haven Ave\, Cranston\, RI 02920
DESCRIPTION:Culinary speed dating at the Post\, hosted by Chef Kimberly And
 rade (Chef's Soulful Compass). Eight 10-minute dates over six internationa
 lly inspired tasting courses. Limited to 8 women and 8 men\; 21+. $75 per 
 person\, with an optional $5 donation to the Post\; tickets through Eventb
 rite. The menu is fixed and cannot accommodate allergies or dietary restri
 ctions.\nhttps://www.eventbrite.com/e/feed-dating-presents-around-the-worl
 d-in-8-dates-culinary-speed-dating-tickets-2002246508205
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/feed-dating-presents-around-the-world-in-8
 -dates-culinary-speed-dating-tickets-2002246508205
END:VEVENT
