SUMMARY:Trivia Night at the Post
LOCATION:VFW Post 4651\, 7 Haven Ave\, Cranston\, RI 02920
DESCRIPTION:Weekly trivia night at the Post\, hosted by Logiq & Kobi D. wit
 h music by DJ Rukiz. Teams of four\, three rounds\, one winner each week\;
  categories include music\, TV theme songs\, movies\, sports and general k
 nowledge. Doors open at 7 p.m.\; trivia starts at 8. Free admission. The 1
 0-week season ends with a finale for a $500 prize.
